{"seq":3,"slug":"consolidation-fee","title":"集运服务费与分摊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-savings/consolidation-fee","wordCount":2400,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"集运服务费与分摊\">集运服务费与分摊</h1><p>合单省下的钱不是自动落到任何一方账上的。省的钱是一个<strong>整组的量</strong>（一次跨境运输被省掉了），而承担成本与获得收益的是<strong>多个主体</strong>——多个订单、多个买家、多个卖家，以及提供合包服务的平台或集运服务商。这一篇解决的是「这笔钱怎么分」：集运服务费怎么收，以及合单节省怎么在各方之间分摊，才能既覆盖成本又不扭曲激励。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先区分两笔方向相反的钱，它们的处理方式完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>集运服务费</strong>是提供合包服务一方<strong>向使用方收取</strong>的费用，覆盖集运仓的作业与仓储。它由若干可枚举的收费项构成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收费项</th>\n<th>计费基</th>\n<th>典型触发</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>入库操作费</td>\n<td>按件</td>\n<td>每件到仓</td>\n<td>收货、扫描、抽检、上架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓储/占位费</td>\n<td>按件·天</td>\n<td>超过免费等待期后</td>\n<td>按占用暂存位天数计，鼓励及时合包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合包操作费</td>\n<td>按母包</td>\n<td>每次合包</td>\n<td>拣货、装箱、称重量方、面单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增值服务费</td>\n<td>按次</td>\n<td>加固、换箱、贴标、拍照、电池申报</td>\n<td>买家或卖家可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出库交接费</td>\n<td>按母包</td>\n<td>每次出库</td>\n<td>与承运商交接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆包/退仓费</td>\n<td>按次</td>\n<td>拆单、退货回仓</td>\n<td>合单失败路径的成本，见第三章第 2 篇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>合单节省</strong>（上一篇算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>）是<strong>少支出的钱</strong>，它不属于任何一方的应收账款，而是需要在参与方之间分配的一个剩余（surplus）。这两笔钱经常被混在一起算成「净收益」，导致分摊口径混乱：服务费是成本项、要在分摊前扣除；节省是待分配的剩余、是分摊的对象。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[合单组的毛节省 Total] --&gt; B[扣除集运服务费]&#10;    B --&gt; C[净节省 Delta]&#10;    C --&gt; D{分摊基选择}&#10;    D --&gt;|按计费重| E[各订单按 w_i 占比]&#10;    D --&gt;|按件数| F[各订单均分]&#10;    D --&gt;|按申报价值| G[各订单按 value 占比]&#10;    E --&gt; H[落账到各订单]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[买家侧: 退运费或免运费]&#10;    H --&gt; J[卖家侧: 降运费 or 平台留存]\">graph TD\n    A[合单组的毛节省 Total] --&gt; B[扣除集运服务费]\n    B --&gt; C[净节省 Delta]\n    C --&gt; D{分摊基选择}\n    D --&gt;|按计费重| E[各订单按 w_i 占比]\n    D --&gt;|按件数| F[各订单均分]\n    D --&gt;|按申报价值| G[各订单按 value 占比]\n    E --&gt; H[落账到各订单]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[买家侧: 退运费或免运费]\n    H --&gt; J[卖家侧: 降运费 or 平台留存]</pre><h2 id=\"分摊基的选择与它的激励后果\">分摊基的选择与它的激励后果</h2><p>分摊基（allocation basis）是「按什么比例把净节省分给各订单」。常见的三种及其后果：</p>\n<p><strong>按计费重占比</strong>：订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 分到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\cdot w_i / \\sum_j w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这是最「有理由」的一种，因为跨境段的成本本身就与计费重相关，且计费重的次可加性收益（见 <a href=\"weight-volume-combine\">合包重量/体积重合并计费</a>）在重货与抛货混搭时最大，重货多分了它带来的收益。缺点是它需要一个稳定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——重量大的订单会「看起来」受益最多，但如果收益其实来自某件极抛的货压缩了整包体积，按重分摊会低估该抛货的贡献。</p>\n<p><strong>按件数均分</strong>：订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 分到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta / n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。最简单、最可解释，买家侧最好沟通（「一共合了 3 单，每单退 1/3」）。缺点是当各件重量体积差异巨大时明显不公平：一个 10kg 的货与两个 0.1kg 的货合单，均分会让小件拿走与他们贡献不符的份额。</p>\n<p><strong>按申报价值占比</strong>：订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 分到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\cdot v_i / \\sum_j v_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。适用于对买家侧的分摊（买家体验上「贵的单分摊多」不直观，但对卖家侧的账务分摊合理，因为高值货通常也是高运费货）。它在跨境合单中还有一个合规相关的好处：分摊结果与清关申报的价值占比一致，便于对账。</p>\n<p>实践中常用的方案是<strong>分层混合</strong>：买家侧按件数均分（可解释性优先），卖家侧按计费重占比（成本相关性优先）。两侧用不同分摊基并不矛盾，因为两侧面对的是不同的关系——买家与平台之间是零售定价关系，卖家与平台之间是成本结算关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分摊基</th>\n<th>可解释性</th>\n<th>成本相关性</th>\n<th>适用侧</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计费重占比</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>卖家/成本结算</td>\n<td>低估抛货对压缩体积的贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>件数均分</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>买家/零售侧</td>\n<td>重量差异大时失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申报价值占比</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>卖家/账务对账</td>\n<td>高值低重货被高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shapley 值</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>大客户/争议场景</td>\n<td>计算复杂，需定义特征函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Shapley 值</strong>在这里是有理论依据的：合单的节省是一个<strong>合作博弈的剩余</strong>，每笔订单是玩家，任意子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的收益是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 合并相比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 各自发的节省」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则公平分摊是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Shapley 值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i = \\sum_{S \\subseteq N \\setminus \\{i\\}} \\frac{|S|! \\, (n - |S| - 1)!}{n!} \\left[ v(S \\cup \\{i\\}) - v(S) \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Shapley 值的性质（有效性、对称性、零贡献者零分配）恰好对应公平分摊的三条直觉。但它的代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个子集，因此只适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很小（合单组通常 2–5 件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^5 = 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span> 可算）或作为争议时的<strong>参照口径</strong>用于校准简化的分摊基。工程上不建议把 Shapley 作为常规分摊算法，但建议把它作为「分摊基是否严重偏离公平」的审计基准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落账时点与拆单还原\">落账时点与拆单还原</h2><p>分摊解决了「分多少」，还有两个时点问题必须定。</p>\n<p><strong>落账时点。</strong> 节省在什么时候变成各方账上的数？三种选择：合单决策时（估算值，可能有偏差）、母包实际出库并取得实际运费后（实测值，最准）、结算周期末（滞后但口径统一）。推荐做法是<strong>决策时估算、出库后确认、结算时以确认值落账</strong>，并保留差额的调整记录。理由与上一篇一致：估算与结算必须同源，否则偏差会被误读为「合单不划算」。</p>\n<p><strong>拆单还原。</strong> 合单之后若发生取消或退货（见 <a href=\"../merge-conflict/merge-unmerge-safe\">合单后取消/退货拆单</a>），已分摊的节省必须能被还原。这要求分摊记录里保存<strong>分摊基的输入快照</strong>（各订单当时的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与<strong>分摊结果</strong>，还原时按剩余订单重新计算分摊并生成调整分录，而不是简单地把被拆走订单的那一份平摊给剩下的。简单平摊会在多次拆单后累积偏差——每次拆单都把误差放大一次，这是拆单场景最常见的账务缺陷。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是通过 Shapley 或按档位枚举算出的，还原时应当用<strong>同一算法在剩余集合上重算</strong>。这使「分摊算法」成为必须版本化的一部分：账务调整的可复现性依赖于当时用的是哪个分摊版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谁付服务费-三种商业模式\">谁付服务费：三种商业模式</h2><p>集运服务费由谁承担，直接决定这套系统的激励结构。</p>\n<p><strong>模式一：买家付（集运模式）。</strong> 买家在跨境集运平台上主动选择「合并寄送」，为省运费而支付一笔集运服务费（通常远低于省下的运费）。此时服务费的定价必须让买家在多数情况下<strong>净省</strong>，否则没有人会选；同时平台要防止「合单后反而更贵」的情形（上一篇的否决逻辑在这里是产品底线）。</p>\n<p><strong>模式二：卖家付（平台代操作）。</strong> 平台为提升买家体验，主动为同买家的多笔单合包，服务费由平台承担或按协议向卖家收取。此时服务费的规模必须被跨境段的节省覆盖，否则平台在做亏本生意；平台留存部分节省作为对合包服务的补偿是常见安排。</p>\n<p><strong>模式三：平台承担，作为体验投资。</strong> 平台把合单当作降低物流成本与提升体验的手段，不单独收费，节省全部让给买家或留存。此时系统仍需计算服务费（作为内部成本核算），因为它决定「这个合包动作在内部账上是否创造价值」。</p>\n<p>三种模式的共同要求是：<strong>服务费的收费项必须与作业活动一一对应</strong>。若把入库、仓储、合包、拆包都打包成一个「服务费」，就无法回答「这次合包在哪个环节亏了」，也无法在拆单时把成本还原到正确的责任方。收费项的粒度应当至少能区分「一次性的合包成本」与「随等待时长增长的占位成本」——因为前者可控、后者揭示了等待管理的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>必须区分两笔方向相反的钱：集运服务费是成本项（分摊前扣除），合单节省是待分配的剩余（分摊对象）；混算会导致口径混乱。</li>\n<li>分摊基可选计费重占比（成本相关，适合卖家侧）、件数均分（可解释，适合买家侧）、申报价值占比（便于对账）；分层混合是常见实践。</li>\n<li>Shapley 值在理论上是公平分摊的正解，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度使其只适合小规模或作为审计基准，不宜作常规算法。</li>\n<li>落账时点应「决策时估算、出库后确认、结算时落账并留调整记录」；拆单还原必须记录分摊基快照并按剩余集合重算，简单平摊会逐次放大误差。</li>\n<li>分摊与还原算法必须版本化，账务调整的可复现性依赖它。</li>\n<li>服务费收费项要与作业活动一一对应，且至少区分一次性合包成本与随时长增长的占位成本。</li>\n<li>拆单的费用还原见 <a href=\"../merge-conflict/merge-unmerge-safe\">合单后取消/退货拆单</a>；等待占位成本的来源见 <a href=\"../consolidation-model/consolidation-warehouse\">集运仓模式与中转集货</a>；节省公式本身见 <a href=\"freight-savings-calc\">合单运费节省与门槛计算</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"集运服务费与分摊","id":"集运服务费与分摊"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊基的选择与它的激励后果","id":"分摊基的选择与它的激励后果"},{"level":2,"text":"落账时点与拆单还原","id":"落账时点与拆单还原"},{"level":2,"text":"谁付服务费：三种商业模式","id":"谁付服务费-三种商业模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合包重量/体积重合并计费","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-savings/weight-volume-combine"},"next":{"title":"截单时间/备货不同步冲突","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-consolidation-group-ship/merge-conflict/time-window-conflict"}}